  "slug": "skill-safety-auditor",
  "name": "Skill Safety Auditor",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Skill Safety Auditor is a Claude Code skill that audits third-party skills for security risks before or after you install them. It runs 14 checks across credential access, shell commands, prompt injection, and source provenance, rating each finding Critical, Warning, or Info.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `skill-safety-auditor` (Audits a Claude Code skill for security risks in three modes: before download (from a URL or install…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install skill-safety-auditor@claude-community` from `mtthwmllr/skill-safety-auditor-plugin` (`plugins/skill-safety-auditor`).",
